0235E17930</modified_by_id><modified_on>2026-06-18T18:34:12</modified_on><new_version>1</new_version><release_date is_null=\"1\" /><state>DRAFT2</state></Item><Item type=\"EWO_O\" typeId=\"3B5FDC430A344CA3845AF50CCE1CB8C1\" id=\"A989E0AFE8324AC3862F5E807C821EFC\" page=\"1\"><_affect_3c>0</_affect_3c><_affect_3c_cert>0</_affect_3c_cert><_affect_appearance>0</_affect_appearance><_affect_fe>0</_affect_fe><_affect_green>0</_affect_green><_affect_manufacture>1</_affect_manufacture><_affect_notice>1</_affect_notice><_affect_online_config>1</_affect_online_config><_affect_ots>1</_affect_ots><_affect_ots_time>2026-10-28T00:00:00</_affect_ots_time><_affect_ppap>1</_affect_ppap><_affect_ppap_time>2026-12-28T00:00:00</_affect_ppap_time><_affect_service>0</_affect_service><_affect_service_type is_null=\"1\" /><_affect_vehicle_basic_data>0</_affect_vehicle_basic_data><_area>BJ-KD-00</_area><_change_description>F520M中东整车出口项目增加EPS转向管柱总成零件号（27233138）。\r\nFor the F520M Middle East vehicle export project, the EPS steering column assembly part number (27233138) has been added.</_change_description><_change_purpose is_null=\"1\" /><_change_reason_description>根据F520M中东整车出口项目定点分包策略，EPS转向管柱总成，硬件借用F520MR，软件适配CVT开发。\r\nIn accordance with the fixed-point subcontracting strategy for the F520M Middle East vehicle export project, the EPS steering column assembly is developed with hardware borrowed from F520MR and software adapted to CVT.</_change_reason_description><_coordinated_change>0</_coordinated_change><_coordinated_implement_comments is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_paa is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_part_name is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_wo is_null=\"1\" /><_cross_reference_brief is_null=\"1\" /><_cvcev>型号：COLE64</_cvcev><_division>1</_division><_dopcpc is_null=\"1\" /><_idle_days>2</_idle_days><_is_buy>1</_is_buy><_is_self_made>0</_is_self_made><_kdlc_strategy is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_req is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_res is_null=\"1\" /><_mockup>1</_mockup><_modelinfo>F520M</_modelinfo><_no>EWO-047829</_no><_project_type>1</_project_type><_ptr>1</_ptr><_required_date>2027-01-28T00:00:00</_required_date><_road_test>1</_road_test><_rsp keyed_name=\"屈鹏(q22400595)\" type=\"User\">842D6D22DEC7468496AFFB84949F92A0</_rsp><_rsp_department>技术中心_能源驱动</_rsp_department><_rsp_name>屈鹏(q22400595)</_rsp_name><_rsp_phone>15025735516</_rsp_phone><_rsp_smt>底盘工程科</_rsp_smt><_sort_sub_type>PWO-EWO定点</_sort_sub_type><_sort_type>PWO</_sort_type><_subject>F520M中东整车出口项目EPS转向管柱定点发布。\r\nThe EPS steering column for the F520M Middle East vehicle export project has been officially announced.</_subject><_submit_time>2026-06-18T18:02:19</_submit_time><_test_lab>0</_test_lab><_vce is_null=\"1\" /><_vehicle_param>0</_vehicle_param><_wo_type>1</_wo_type><created_by_id keyed_name=\"屈鹏(q22400595)\" type=\"User\">842D6D22DEC7468496AFFB84949F92A0</created_by_id><created_on>2026-05-14T10:43:54</created_on><css is_null=\"1\" /><current_state name=\"OPEN\" keyed_name=\"OPEN\" type=\"Life Cycle State\">E3326C0F08804F5D81BE2249DC68A66A</current_state><effective_date is_null=\"1\" /><eplmwriteneplcode is_null=\"1\" /><generation>1</generation><id keyed_name=\"EWO-047829\" type=\"EWO_O\">A989E0AFE8324AC3862F5E807C821EFC</id><is_current>1</is_current><keyed_name>EWO-047829</keyed_name><locked_by_id is_null=\"1\" /><major_rev>A</major_rev><modified_by_id keyed_name=\"屈鹏(q22400595)\" type=\"User\">842D6D22DEC7468496AFFB84949F92A0</modified_by_id><modified_on>2026-06-18T18:02:46</modified_on><new_version>1</new_version><release_date is_null=\"1\" /><state>OPEN</state></Item><Item type=\"EWO_O\" typeId=\"3B5FDC430A344CA3845AF50CCE1CB8C1\" id=\"968DB3E918EE4E3485D7D190094989A0\" page=\"1\"><_affect_3c>0</_affect_3c><_affect_3c_cert>0</_affect_3c_cert><_affect_appearance>0</_affect_appearance><_affect_fe>0</_affect_fe><_affect_green>0</_affect_green><_affect_manufacture>1</_affect_manufacture><_affect_notice>0</_affect_notice><_affect_online_config>0</_affect_online_config><_affect_ots>1</_affect_ots><_affect_ots_time>2026-06-26T00:00:00</_affect_ots_time><_affect_ppap>1</_affect_ppap><_affect_ppap_time>2026-07-10T00:00:00</_affect_ppap_time><_affect_service>1</_affect_service><_affect_service_type>3</_affect_service_type><_affect_vehicle_basic_data>0</_affect_vehicle_basic_data><_area>BJ-KD-00,HX-GA-00</_area><_change_description>1、增大母扣头部外径。\r\n2、子母扣夹持厚度由3.5mm改为4.0mm。\r\n3、PP蜂窝板主定位孔由φ6.5mm改为φ7.0mm，副定位孔由（8×6.5）mm改为（9×7）mm，刀模修模；涉及：右后门装饰板总成（2座6座）、左尾门装饰板总成（2座6座）、右尾门装饰板总成（2座）、右尾门装饰板总成（6座）。\r\n4、更正左/右尾门饰板总成的零件名称。\r\n更新相关数据、EPL</_change_description><_change_purpose>2</_change_purpose><_change_reason_description>1、夹持式防水母扣头部的尺寸偏小，强度不足，拆卸易断。\r\n2、子母扣设计的夹持厚度为3.5mm，PP蜂窝板的厚度实测为（3.4~3. 65）mm，会导致个别母扣插入力较大，难装到位，导致过坏路后脱落。\r\n3、关联夹持式防水子母扣尺寸更改，PP蜂窝板主副定位孔更改尺寸。\r\n4、左/右尾门饰板总成左件和右件写反，影响总装线旁物料排序。</_change_reason_description><_coordinated_change>0</_coordinated_change><_coordinated_implement_comments is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_paa is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_part_name is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_wo is_null=\"1\" /><_cross_reference_brief is_null=\"1\" /><_cvcev is_null=\"1\" /><_division>1</_division><_dopcpc is_null=\"1\" /><_idle_days>2</_idle_days><_is_buy>1</_is_buy><_is_self_made>0</_is_self_made><_kdlc_strategy is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_req is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_res is_null=\"1\" /><_mockup>0</_mockup><_modelinfo>N001;N001依维柯</_modelinfo><_no>EWO-047828</_no><_project_type>1</_project_type><_ptr>0</_ptr><_required_date>2026-11-30T00:00:00</_required_date><_road_test>0</_road_test><_rsp keyed_name=\"梁世亮(l22400590)\" type=\"User\">741BB9DE5B344474B59D9EEC07D3C3FD</_rsp><_rsp_department>技术中心_车体工程</_rsp_department><_rsp_name>梁世亮(l22400590)</_rsp_name><_rsp_phone></_rsp_phone><_rsp_smt>内饰科</_rsp_smt><_sort_sub_type>PWO-设计变更</_sort_sub_type><_sort_type>PWO</_sort_type><_subject>N001夹持式防水子母扣、右后门装饰板总成（PP蜂窝板）、左右尾门装饰板总成（PP蜂窝板）更改</_subject><_submit_time>2026-06-18T17:32:52</_submit_time><_test_lab>0</_test_lab><_vce is_null=\"1\" /><_vehicle_param>0</_vehicle_param><_wo_type>1</_wo_type><