/_affect_appearance><_affect_fe>0</_affect_fe><_affect_green>0</_affect_green><_affect_manufacture>1</_affect_manufacture><_affect_notice>0</_affect_notice><_affect_online_config>0</_affect_online_config><_affect_ots>1</_affect_ots><_affect_ots_time>2026-08-30T00:00:00</_affect_ots_time><_affect_ppap>1</_affect_ppap><_affect_ppap_time>2026-09-30T00:00:00</_affect_ppap_time><_affect_service>1</_affect_service><_affect_service_type>1</_affect_service_type><_affect_vehicle_basic_data>0</_affect_vehicle_basic_data><_area>BJ-GA-00</_area><_change_description>底盘线束总成：\r\n1、在EWO-043521基础上更改零件号便于断点实施和防错，成本不变。\r\n仪表线束总成：\r\n1、线束分支匹配E-CALL扬声器位置更改，增加固定卡扣157-01105，插件型号由PP0413902改为PP0452601；\r\n2、增加TBXO相关代码UE9&amp;[-ZY]、UE9&amp;[ZY]进行2G E-CALL和4G E-CALL配置区分，LV2中东出口车型取消UE9&amp;[-ZY]代码勾选，增加UE9&amp;[ZY]代码勾选。\r\n</_change_description><_change_purpose>7</_change_purpose><_change_reason_description>1、310S 整车出口中东车型为满足法规要求升级4G E-CALL，TBOX及E-CALL扬声器开发策略变更，线束匹配更改，涉及仪表线束总成和底盘线束总成。前期已下发EWO-043521进行更改并且零件已定价，后续因为与310S MY27升级侧柱碰的EWO-044297存在断点先后顺序问题已取消EWO-043521。现下发新EWO在MY27升级侧柱碰基础上增加4G ECALL更改。\r\n2、inline插件平台化，更改为住友带防歪针结构插件。</_change_reason_description><_coordinated_change>1</_coordinated_change><_coordinated_implement_comments is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_paa is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_part_name>TBOX、E-CALL扬声器、扬声器盖板组件</_coordinated_part_name><_coordinated_wo>EWO-042183、EWO-042845、EWO-043314</_coordinated_wo><_cross_reference_brief is_null=\"1\" /><_cvcev is_null=\"1\" /><_division>1</_division><_dopcpc is_null=\"1\" /><_idle_days>3</_idle_days><_is_buy>1</_is_buy><_is_self_made>0</_is_self_made><_kdlc_strategy is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_req is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_res is_null=\"1\" /><_mockup>0</_mockup><_modelinfo>310S</_modelinfo><_no>EWO-047806</_no><_project_type>1</_project_type><_ptr>1</_ptr><_required_date>2026-12-30T00:00:00</_required_date><_road_test>0</_road_test><_rsp is_null=\"1\" /><_rsp_department>技术中心_电子电器工程</_rsp_department><_rsp_name>蒋惠雨(js2500633)</_rsp_name><_rsp_phone>