承接河西喷涂线公告及生产一致性会议纪要》，后蒙皮由五菱工业承接河西喷涂，E112C国内、E112CR印尼、E112CR泰国倒车雷达使用车间变更。\r\n\r\nAccording to the \"Announcement on Wuling Industry Taking Over the Hexi Spraying Line and Minutes of the Production Consistency Meeting\", the rear skins will be taken over by Wuling Industry for the Hexi spraying. The workshops using the reversing radars for E112C in China, E112CR in Indonesia, and E112CR in Thailand have been changed.</_change_reason_description><_coordinated_change>1</_coordinated_change><_coordinated_implement_comments is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_paa is_null=\"1\" /><_coordinated_part_name>后蒙皮总成</_coordinated_part_name><_coordinated_wo is_null=\"1\" /><_cross_reference_brief is_null=\"1\" /><_cvcev is_null=\"1\" /><_division>1</_division><_dopcpc is_null=\"1\" /><_idle_days>3</_idle_days><_is_buy>1</_is_buy><_is_self_made>0</_is_self_made><_kdlc_strategy is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_req is_null=\"1\" /><_m_ncr_res is_null=\"1\" /><_mockup>0</_mockup><_modelinfo>E112C;印尼E112CR;E112CR整车出口泰国</_modelinfo><_no>EWO-047796</_no><_project_type>1</_project_type><_ptr>0</_ptr><_required_date>2026-10-31T00:00:00</_required_date><_road_test>0</_road_test><_rsp keyed_name=\"周伦旭(z22100353)\" type=\"User\">F00029297F3E428C98D08DF9BA5BDD38</_rsp><_rsp_department>技术中心_智驾网联</_rsp_department><_rsp_name>周伦旭(z22100353)</_rsp_name><_rsp_phone>18507722954</_rsp_phone><_rsp_smt>智驾网联硬件科</_rsp_smt><_sort_sub_type>PWO-设计变更</_sort_sub_type><_sort_type>PWO</_sort_type><_subject>E112C国内、E112CR印尼、E112CR泰国倒车雷达使用车间变更。\r\nThe workshops using the reversing radars for E112C in China, E112CR in Indonesia, and E112CR in Thailand have been changed.</_subject><_submit_time>2026-06-17T16:35:21</_submit_time><_test_lab>0</_test_lab><_vce is_null=\"1\" /><_vehicle_param>0</_vehicle_param><_wo_type>1</_wo_type><created_by_id keyed_name=\"周伦旭(z22100353)\" type=\"User\">F00029297F3E428C98D08DF9BA5BDD38</created_by_id><created_on>2026-06-17T15:00:41</created_on><css is_null=\"1\" /><current_state name=\"DRAFT1\" key